<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that UNUM Corp and Fair Isaac &amp; Co Inc were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said American Eagle Group Inc, Payless Cashways Inc, Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Corimon SACA were also unavailable.</p>
</text>
